cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Luvs Creator Price Index"
abstract: >-
  Monthly aggregate statistics on subscription pricing and discounting in the
  creator economy, computed from publicly visible profile data. Aggregates only,
  with no per-creator rows and a minimum of 15 profiles behind any breakdown.
  Releases are frozen when the month closes; a correction is published openly,
  never applied silently.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "LuvsOne"
    website: "https://luvs.one"
url: "https://luvs.one/stats"
repository-code: "https://github.com/luvsone/creator-price-index"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - creator economy
  - subscription pricing
  - price index
  - discounting
  - open data
